    "description": "## Objective\n\nTwo Salesforce-native dashboards over the sample data for the demo close.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Dashboard 1 — Book of Business: Deals by Partner, by Market, by Vertical\n* Dashboard 2 — Sign-Up Pipeline: Sign-Ups by Status, overdue count\n* Two reports per dashboard; standard report types where possible\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* Both dashboards render with the sample data\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nVisual check.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nFull BI dashboard suite (lives in the BI tool, later phase).\n\n---\n\nEstimate: S · \\~3h · Dependencies: POC-11 · Ticket POC-15 (approved 2026-07-04)",
